00:06:06.759 --> 00:06:14.330
Okay. So, what are the chances? Literally
1 in 100 million -- and maybe even LESS.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:19.439
In the handwriting analysis I did of Sylvia
Howland’s will, Hetty Green’s forgery

00:06:19.439 --> 00:06:26.169
matched on way too many points to chalk it
up to a crazy coincidence, 1 in sextillions.

00:06:26.169 --> 00:06:31.360
Gehlbach calculated p-values to estimate the
chance of Gilbert’s nursing death-rate at

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:37.580
less than 1 in 100 million… but we know
from the Sally Clark trial that a probability

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:46.750
like 1 in 73 million isn’t necessarily what
it feels like it is. Correlation isn’t causation.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.889
Maybe her patients were just sicker than normal.

00:06:49.889 --> 00:06:56.260
This time, that uncertainty was okay -- it
was enough for the grand jury to proceed.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:07:02.631
A grand jury doesn’t have to determine guilt
or innocence the way a trial does. They just

00:07:02.631 --> 00:07:08.969
decide whether the evidence is compelling
enough to proceed with criminal charges. They

00:07:08.969 --> 00:07:09.969
did.

00:07:09.969 --> 00:07:16.409
Again. There wasn’t proof. But the math
gave enough context to the suspicions of the

00:07:16.409 --> 00:07:22.539
Veterans Administration, hospital management,
and Gilbert’s co-workers to proceed with

00:07:22.539 --> 00:07:29.810
charges -- but how was she killing these people?
And WHY?!?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:34.650
Prosecutors alleged that Gilbert had injected
patients with epinephrine – which you probably

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:40.870
know as adrenaline, which sped up their hearts
and caused cardiac failure. Adrenaline is

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:47.059
untraceable, but the hospital found that it
had a lot of epinephrine go missing during

00:07:47.059 --> 00:07:53.669
Gilbert’s employment. And some of the patients
-- like Henry Hudon, who was relatively young

00:07:53.669 --> 00:07:59.749
and a paranoid-schizophrenia patient, weren’t
likely to have 3 heart attacks in one night

00:07:59.749 --> 00:08:03.729
without something artificially causing it.

00:08:03.729 --> 00:08:12.630
But… why would a professional mother of
2 in suburbia become a deranged super-villain?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:21.880
Well… She seemed to have delusions of grandeur
in which she herself put patients in critical

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:29.430
condition and then heroically tried to resuscitate
them. She had a history of manipulative behavior,

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:36.669
mental illness, and abuse of patients -- as
a home care aide in the 1980s, she scalded

00:08:36.669 --> 00:08:42.589
a mentally disabled child with hot bath water
on purpose.

00:08:42.589 --> 00:08:51.240
Kristen Gilbert may have been unhinged -- but
she was also in love. Obsessively in love.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:58.120
Every time a patient coded, hospital policy
mandated that a police officer engage in CPR.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:05.250
In late 1995 and early 1996, the same police
officer responded to every single cardiac

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:13.110
arrest that Gilbert reported: James Perrault,
Kristen’s boyfriend. The man she left her

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:19.540
husband and two children for. Witnesses noticed
her touching Perrault affectionately during

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:26.321
resuscitation efforts and wiping his sweaty
brow. Court papers show that "One witness

00:09:26.321 --> 00:09:33.570
will testify that he observed Gilbert playing
`footsie' with Perrault during the middle

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.190
of a code.” Gross.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:42.920
Perrault ended the relationship, and Gilbert
was angry. On a phone call from a psychiatric

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:49.130
facility, she confessed to him by saying,
"You know I did it. I did it. You wanted to

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:55.730
know. I killed those guys." Perrault immediately
went to the authorities, so… she called

00:09:55.730 --> 00:10:00.500
in a bomb threat to the VA hospital where
they worked.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:05.810
Decades of troubling behavior culminated in
a systematic killing spree that allowed Gilbert

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:13.510
to be the focal point of crisis after crisis.
Staff testified about her access to the adrenaline

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:20.829
that induced cardiac events, and doctors testified
that the unexpected excess deaths were often

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:28.600
relatively healthy, middle-aged men. The same
pattern just kept happening.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:34.320
Kristen Gilbert was convicted of 4 murders
and 2 attempted murders -- and the bomb threat

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:41.630
to a federal facility. It’s possible -- and
probable -- that she was involved in many,

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:48.170
many more patient deaths that weren’t the
accidents they seemed to be, but prosecutors

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:54.250
couldn’t prove it. She could’ve faced
the death penalty, but a compassionate judge

00:10:54.250 --> 00:11:00.060
and jury sentenced her to a life in prison
without the possibility of parole -- plus

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:01.759
20 years.

00:11:01.759 --> 00:11:07.190
The mathematical analysis that was so critical
to Gilbert’s downfall wasn’t even used

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:13.449
at the trial. The trial judge ruled that the
statistical evidence was prejudicial, as it

00:11:13.449 --> 00:11:20.360
likely wouldn’t be understood by the jury
as NOT being iron-clad numerical proof of

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.460
her guilt.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:28.420
I’ve shown that math can be an incredible
asset in court… or that it can turn innocent

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:34.220
people into criminals. We’re getting used
to scientific and mathematical evidence, like

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:42.639
DNA and forensics, determining guilt or innocence
-- but the reality is math and science don’t

00:11:42.639 --> 00:11:44.810
have to do all the work.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:53.430
Dozens, and maybe hundreds, of veterans are
alive in Massachusetts because of a bar graph.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:59.830
Math and science don’t always have to put
out the fire. Sometimes all they should do

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:07.220
— and all they need to do — is sound the
alarm.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:21.569
And as always, thanks for watching.

